  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Sovereignty does not mean isolation. The quality of your life will be shaped by the quality of the people around you.",
      "start": 1.12,
      "end": 7.839,
      "wordStart": 0,
      "wordEnd": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose friends who are pleased when you grow. Find builders, teachers, thoughtful critics, and people who keep their word. Spend less time with cynics who mistake resignation for intelligence.",
      "start": 8.8,
      "end": 21.639,
      "wordStart": 21,
      "wordEnd": 49
    },
    {
      "text": "Call your family. Show up when it matters. Say the kind thing while the person is still present to hear it. Ambition is a poor excuse for neglect.",
      "start": 22.899,
      "end": 34.88,
      "wordStart": 50,
      "wordEnd": 77
    },
    {
      "text": "Your environment quietly becomes your standard. Courage spreads. Discipline spreads. So do excuses. Be careful what you allow to become normal.",
      "start": 36.099,
      "end": 50.159,
      "wordStart": 78,
      "wordEnd": 98
    },
    {
      "text": "Build a life that has room for people. Success experienced alone becomes surprisingly small.",
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 59.5,
      "wordStart": 99,
      "wordEnd": 112
    }
  ],
